                                "target_word": "homoflexible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad697a4c-ae19-315f-a496-6b671590b6cd",
                                        "entry_id": "e13e3065-46fa-33d0-b69a-566c3afad01b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Primarily homosexual, but with a limited amount of attraction to other genders, or willingness to take part in a heterosexual activity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "968e7553-ba39-4b03-95ed-464f4a9906dd",
                                                "sense_id": "ad697a4c-ae19-315f-a496-6b671590b6cd",
                                                "text": "Another student, who identified himself as “homoflexible,” said,“I live with straight guys now,and I definitely see the sexual tensions, which have made me very uncomfortable\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35c446e8-2862-4dd2-956b-9396a0ad779e",
                                                "sense_id": "ad697a4c-ae19-315f-a496-6b671590b6cd",
                                                "text": "opposite sex, it is said, but are not averse to exploring their 'gay side'. 'Homoflexible' suggests the reverse. Some men and women enjoy an even more fluid set of desires and see themselves as 'flexi-sexual'. 'pansexual', 'omnisexual'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb616d07-ddd4-4262-a479-dfb9af32af15",
                                                "sense_id": "ad697a4c-ae19-315f-a496-6b671590b6cd",
                                                "text": "Many adolescents and young adults prefer terms such as: bi-curi- ous, fluid, hetero- or homo-flexible, open, omni- or pan-sexual, polyamorous, questioning, or queer (Driver, 2007, pp. 42-A3; Meyer, 2008)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f822a81-89c1-4093-b271-385759d6ab7e",
                                                "sense_id": "ad697a4c-ae19-315f-a496-6b671590b6cd",
                                                "text": "I have many gay friends whom are homoflexible and many of them have had adventures with members of the opposite sex solely because they wanted kids."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d199f8f4-571f-409f-b64d-26f28add8036",
                                                "sense_id": "ad697a4c-ae19-315f-a496-6b671590b6cd",
                                                "text": "Hunter was a man who was bi-curious about women, rather than a man who was bi-curious about other men. Hunter was homoflexible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25b35a89-c292-40fd-b8fa-58a8392cde78",
                                                "sense_id": "ad697a4c-ae19-315f-a496-6b671590b6cd",
                                                "text": "In my experience, some heteroflexible men do not test bisexual. (I should note that I have also met a few homoflexible men.)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
